3.4.1.3.3 Naming named imports
In general symbols imported via the named import ( `import{name}` ) should keep the same name. Avoid aliasing imports ( `import{SomeThingasSomeOtherThing}` ). Prefer fixing name collisions by using a module import ( `import*` ) or renaming the exports themselves.
