switch (a) {
    case 0 :break;
    default :foo();
}
```

Examples of correct code for this rule:


```json
/*eslint switch-colon-spacing: "error"*/

switch (a) {
    case 0: foo(); break;
    case 1:
        bar();
        break;
    default:
        baz();
        break;
}
```

Examples of incorrect code for this rule with `{"after": false, "before": true}` option:


