{}

if (foo) {
    bar();
    {
        baz();
    }
}

function bar() {
    {
        baz();
    }
}

{
    function foo() {}
}

{
    aLabel: {
    }
}

class C {
    static {
        {
            foo();
        }
    }
}
```

Examples of correct code for this rule with ES6 environment:


```json
